{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"feel\": \"从先前悬着的向往，转为一种可以慢慢沉浸其中的甜美与亲近。既有舒展、安稳的欢喜，也有一点不舍和心酸；后来感情越来越热切，出现一阵格外充实的幸福，随后又归于温柔的留恋，并没有完全安心。\",\n  \"thread\": \"先前只是觉得那份美好值得向往，现在却真的从中尝到了快乐。它不再只是一个令人心动的可能，而是有了一点可以亲自享受的实在内容，所以人能够暂时不去追问结果，只顾着喜欢，甚至觉得这样待着就很好。可越是细细尝到它的好，就越舍不得只有这么一点。原先淡淡的惆怅因此有了更具体的分量，连欢喜也渐渐变得热切。那一阵格外充实的幸福确实让人满足，却也让人更舍不得它过去。\",\n  \"used\": \"第1段中，一种尚未得到的美好已经带来真实的喜悦和向往；最初的热切退去后，在意仍然存在，同时带着尚无依靠的惆怅。\",\n  \"new\": [\n    \"原先只令人向往的美好，现在已经给了人一段能够真切享受、慢慢流连的快乐。\",\n    \"亲自尝到这份快乐以后，眷恋变得更深、更具体；眼前的幸福可以很充实，却仍会让人舍不得它过去。\"\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": \"无\"\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "15205187-9b42-4653-8f94-112b3fdd79e2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T224112532229Z", "elapsed_seconds": 67.844, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T22:42:20.370082+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fb28badf1cdbfb98a3f069976b20b18c3208cff6de37705497f56cbd0774b7ac", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f99